 Create a free account # Sign up for a free developer account for CopilotKit Intelligence to get a license key. You&#x27;ll use it later to enable persistent threads and the inspector. Create your frontend # CopilotKit works with any React-based frontend. We&#x27;ll use Next.js for this example. npx create-next-app@latest my-copilot-app 
